  dialogueLines:
  - "Jolly little fella, aren\u2019t you? Trying to jump around everywhere. Have
    fun being reset"
  - "Look at you, bouncing around like a jolly little fella. Shame you\u2019re about
    to get reset"
  - "Aren\u2019t you a cheerful little jumper? Keep it up and enjoy your lovely reset"
  - "Well, someone\u2019s certainly enthusiastic about jumping. Have fun with the
